# Mila — Cosmetics E-Commerce Website

Mila is a modern cosmetics e-commerce website built as a frontend project.

The website provides a clean and minimal shopping experience for browsing beauty and cosmetic products across multiple categories.

## ✨ Features

- Responsive home page
- Splash screen animation
- Product category navigation
- All products page
- Category-based product filtering
- Individual product detail pages
- Add to Cart functionality
- Persistent cart using Local Storage
- Increase and decrease product quantity
- Remove products from cart
- Automatic subtotal calculation
- Automatic total calculation
- Dynamic cart item count
- Empty cart state
- About Mila page
- Founder section
- Our Story section
- Contact page
- Contact form
- Responsive design

## 🛍️ Product Categories

- Makeup
- Skincare
- Hair
- Fragrance
- Body Care
- Lips

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- jQuery
- Bootstrap 5
- Local Storage

